<title>USA: Hops Grill IPO pulled following merger deal.</title>
<headline>Hops Grill IPO pulled following merger deal.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The proposed initial public offering of Hops Grill &amp; Bar Inc has been pulled after the company's agreement to merge with Apple South Inc, said underwriter Raymond James &amp; Associates.</p>
<p>Apple South announced a deal to acquire the Tampa, Florida-based company for $31.5 million in cash and stock on Feb 7.</p>
<p>Hops operates 18 full-service, casual dining restaurants in Florida, Colorado and Kentucky.</p>
</text>
